~ start
if not StoryFlags.met_homes
	=> first_dialogue
else
	=> nothing_to_say

~ first_dialogue
???: How are the pizzas turning kid?
Roadie: Turning just fine, need to turn up some clues first because i'll be solving this murder
Homes: I'm Homes. Good luck getting any leads out of the people in here
Homes: Everybody lies.
Homes: That's why I only follow the numbers
Homes: I cut the other kinda pies
Roadie: ...Fruit Pies?
Homes: No, pie charts. I'm a data visualization guy
Roadie: Seen any visuals of a crime around here?
Homes: Y'now what? I did! I saw a young 20 something or another walk around a pizza parlor asking dumb questions!
Roadie: ... Seeya around
$> StoryFlags.met_homes = true
=> END

~ nothing_to_say
Homes: Got any new leads kid?
Roadie: Nothing to ask you yet.
Homes: Well come back when you do. I'm almost always eventually right
=> END